1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,250
Drag to select the diagram. Click Pin.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:04,550
Turn the page. The diagram stays in the sidebar.

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,125
Highlight a passage and find it under Marks.

4
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:08,250
Drag a pinned figure onto Ask AI.

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,625
Send a message with the figure and passage attached.

6
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:11,950
Chat shows Thinking, then streams the reply.

7
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,240
Open the pinned figure and select Rectangle.

8
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:16,000
Frame a module, then draw an arrow.
